#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:5
#: 631d8b0518ae4ff89b1ff5709d946b78
msgid "Getting and Setting Parameters"
msgstr "获取与设置参数"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:7
#: 8e44783d2004469fafc7f720018c527b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has hundreds of parameters which allow the user to configure "
"many aspects of how the vehicle flies/drives including attitude "
"controller gains, the minimum safe altitude to return home at when flying"
" in Return-To-Launch mode, etc."
msgstr "ArduPilot 拥有数百个参数，允许用户配置飞行器飞行/驾驶的诸多方面，包括姿态控制器增益、返航飞行模式下返回 Home 的最低安全高度等。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:9
#: 400e0a6b461d46d7a08f6b509f8e3e0e
msgid ""
"This page explains how a ground station or companion computer can "
"retrieve the list of parameters from the flight controller and then make "
"changes to them.  For reference the general purpose `MAVLink parameter "
"protocol is described here "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/parameter.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"本页说明地面站或伴随计算机如何从飞行控制器检索参数列表并进行修改。作为参考，通用 `MAVLink 参数协议说明见此 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/parameter.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:11
#: 4d37e053eff14985a038f4ccf4a807d7
msgid ""
"Most ground stations (aka GCS) provide an editable list of parameters to "
"the user to allow them to customise the vehicle.  Below are links to the "
"human and machine readable parameter names, descriptions and valid ranges"
" but please note that the parameters are different depending upon the "
"vehicle type and also change slightly with each firmware release so GCSs "
"and companion computers should retrieve the list of parameters directly "
"from the flight controller.  Many GCSs also parse the machine readable "
"parameter list (linked below) to provide the description and valid range "
"to the user."
msgstr ""
"大多数地面站（即 "
"GCS）为用户提供可编辑的参数列表，以便自定义飞行器。以下是人类可读和机器可读的参数名称、描述及有效范围的链接，但请注意参数因飞行器类型而异，且每次固件发布都会略有变化，因此"
" GCS 和伴随计算机应直接从飞行控制器检索参数列表。许多 GCS 还会解析下方链接的机器可读参数列表，以向用户显示描述和有效范围。"

